Function: libxml_xmlParserCtxtSetErrorHandler
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: PyparserCtxt_Get(pyobj_ctxt) can return NULL for an invalid or non-context Python object, but the code immediately dereferences ctxt->_private without checking ctxt, leading to a NULL pointer dereference.

